OL,3,GNEWSAFormer world snooker champion
OL,4,AGraeme Dott jailed for child sexual
OL,5,Aabuse
OL,6,
OL,7,FFormer world snooker champion Graeme
OL,8,FDott is jailed for seven years for
OL,9,Fchild sexual abuse offences
OL,11,FThe 49-year-old was convicted in August
OL,12,Fof two charges of lewd and libidinous
OL,13,Fbehaviour towards a girl and a boy
OL,15,FThe offences took place between 1993
OL,16,Fand 2010
OL,18,FDott, who won the world snooker title
OL,19,Fin 2006, showed no emotion as he was
OL,20,Fsentenced at the High Court in
OL,21,FEdinburgh
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
